thena spine> solve
thena spine> along
thena spine> try-core ⌜ \ (x : Nat) (ih : Eq {0} Nat (plus x zero) x) -> congSucc (plus x zero) x ih ⌝
thena spine> solve
thena spine> along
thena spine> solve
